{"title":"2001 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The median of the list\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/0/d10f097a36839fb6dffa8048cecfed506242abb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n, n + 3, n + 4, n + 5, n + 6, n + 8, n + 10, n + 12, n + 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"440\" height=\"16\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. What is the mean?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/b/0ab7f5fa149ff28d0e2c99d22aa59f24586c36ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }4\\qquad\\textbf{(B) }6\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }7\\qquad\\textbf{(D) }10\\qquad\\textbf{(E) }11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"370\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The median of the list is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers in the list, so the median must be the 5th number from the left, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/9/04901235ff573c150d7bedafe9510525f1ace480.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>We substitute the median for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and the equation becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/4/9548316cacb3deb677be83a4914afe308787cfb5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+6=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Subtract both sides by 6 and we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39cf3e35a4981583288d2a7c4b34989916fb7360.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/c/b3c607e076cb5499c11b2ef2a53e91c7a4970dae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+n+3+n+4+n+5+n+6+n+8+n+10+n+12+n+15=9n+63$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"637\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The mean of those numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/d/3cd193f4541fe04174c06a34fa2132af68fc20d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9n+63}{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"62\" height=\"37\" /> which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/0/85054da230c22ee89410783b18f1ffbc4c2bd755.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />. \n</p><p>Substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/1/f31cafe5d0f47652ec403e120e4665d9632c0dc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4+7=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"128\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/GQNnGl3nFok?si=wnPOHufsNE5QbaXY\">https://youtu.be/GQNnGl3nFok?si=wnPOHufsNE5QbaXY</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/9zPaqjUyDJI\">https://youtu.be/9zPaqjUyDJI</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10\" title=\"2001 AMC 10\">2001 AMC 10</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10_Problems\" title=\"2001 AMC 10 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10_Answer_Key\" title=\"2001 AMC 10 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First<br />Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/i